      "source": [
        "# Spatial AI for Urban Traffic Congestion Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "This project explores how geospatial data and unsupervised machine learning can be used to identify and interpret urban traffic congestion patterns.\n",
        "\n",
        "Real-time traffic flow data from the HERE Traffic API is combined with OpenStreetMap roadway data and analyzed using K-Means clustering. Traffic conditions are compared between peak and off-peak periods in downtown San Francisco using congestion metrics, roadway classifications, and spatial characteristics.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Workflow\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Retrieve real-time traffic flow data from the HERE Traffic API\n",
        "2. Construct and enrich roadway data using OpenStreetMap and OSMnx\n",
        "3. Engineer congestion and spatial features\n",
        "4. Standardize features for machine learning\n",
        "5. Apply and evaluate unsupervised clustering methods\n",
        "6. Classify roadway segments by congestion level\n",
        "7. Compare peak and off-peak traffic conditions\n",
        "8. Visualize spatial patterns using Folium\n",
        "9. Summarize model outputs for interpretation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "P669Dm6FISDR"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Import Libraries"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 2,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "nKlPLs0kI0Vk"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import requests\n",
        "import os\n",
        "import geopandas as gpd\n",
        "from shapely.geometry import LineString\n",
        "import folium\n",
        "import branca.colormap as cm\n",
        "from sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n",
        "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n",
        "import osmnx as ox\n",
        "from sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN\n",
        "import numpy as np"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "W9TLFXIDOHve"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Define Traffic Flow Function for HERE API"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 26,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "VLQF5nPtOKcN"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def get_here_traffic_flow_v7(api_key, bbox_str):\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Query HERE Traffic API v7 for flow data within a bounding box.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Parameters:\n",
        "        api_key (str): HERE API key\n",
        "        bbox_str (str): 'west,south,east,north'\n",
        "\n",
        "    Returns:\n",
        "        GeoDataFrame: traffic flows with geometry and congestion attributes\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    url = \"https://data.traffic.hereapi.com/v7/flow\"\n",
        "    params = {\n",
        "        \"in\": f\"bbox:{bbox_str}\",\n",
        "        \"locationReferencing\": \"shape\",\n",
        "        \"apiKey\": api_key\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "    response = requests.get(url, params=params)\n",
        "    data = response.json()\n",
        "\n",
        "    results = data.get(\"results\", [])\n",
        "    records = []\n",
        "    geometries = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for result in results:\n",
        "        shape_links = result.get(\"location\", {}).get(\"shape\", {}).get(\"links\", [])\n",
        "        if not shape_links:\n",
        "            continue\n",
        "\n",
        "        coords = []\n",
        "        for link in shape_links:\n",
        "            points = link.get(\"points\", [])\n",
        "            coords.extend([(pt[\"lng\"], pt[\"lat\"]) for pt in points])\n",
        "\n",
        "        if not coords:\n",
        "            continue\n",
        "\n",
        "        geometry = LineString(coords)\n",
        "\n",
        "        # Extract traffic metrics from currentFlow\n",
        "        flow = result.get(\"currentFlow\", {})\n",
        "        record = {\n",
        "            \"currentSpeed\": flow.get(\"speed\"),\n",
        "            \"freeFlowSpeed\": flow.get(\"freeFlow\"),\n",
        "            \"jamFactor\": flow.get(\"jamFactor\"),\n",
        "            \"confidence\": flow.get(\"confidence\"),\n",
        "            \"roadName\": result.get(\"location\", {}).get(\"description\")\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "        records.append(record)\n",
        "        geometries.append(geometry)\n",
        "\n",
        "    if not records:\n",
        "        print(\"No valid flow segments with shape geometry.\")\n",
        "        return gpd.GeoDataFrame(columns=[\"currentSpeed\", \"freeFlowSpeed\", \"jamFactor\", \"confidence\", \"geometry\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "    gdf = gpd.GeoDataFrame(records, geometry=geometries, crs=\"EPSG:4326\")\n",
        "    return gdf\n"
      ]
    },
